WEBVTT

00:02.760 --> 00:03.190
Huh?

00:03.350 --> 00:06.800
They said I can only be here for five!

00:06.930 --> 00:09.640
"Five"? As in the number five?

00:13.720 --> 00:14.130
Yeah!

00:15.420 --> 00:16.570
Five days!

00:20.840 --> 00:23.570
There it is! The enchantress!

00:26.620 --> 00:27.510
I'm Ai!

00:27.510 --> 00:29.350
Hello, Gramma!

00:29.350 --> 00:32.440
Gramma... me...?

00:32.440 --> 00:35.610
Noooooooooo~!

00:35.900 --> 00:37.100
Busted.

00:59.700 --> 01:05.020
dare mo shiranai basho de

00:59.700 --> 01:05.020
In a place unknown to everyone

01:05.840 --> 01:10.700
asa ga umare hajimeru

01:05.840 --> 01:10.700
The dawn is being born

01:11.060 --> 01:17.140
hoshi inotta negai wo ima wa

01:11.060 --> 01:17.140
The wishes you made upon a star

01:17.140 --> 01:23.040
hikari wo naku shita no ue ni koborete iru

01:17.140 --> 01:23.040
Are spilling forth from where the light had vanished

01:23.340 --> 01:31.950
sotto sukuu tame ni te wo nobasu

01:23.340 --> 01:31.950
I softly extend my hand to rescue you

01:35.140 --> 01:38.270
boku no koe wa sekai wo koete

01:35.140 --> 01:38.270
And my voice envelops the entire world

01:38.290 --> 01:41.360
itsu ka kimi ni tadoritsuku darou

01:38.290 --> 01:41.360
Perhaps some day it will struggle its way to you

01:41.380 --> 01:44.290
toiki morashi yume ga oitemo

01:41.380 --> 01:44.290
Even if you must abandon your dreams, exhale deeply

01:44.540 --> 01:47.430
douka kesshite wasurenu you ni

01:44.540 --> 01:47.430
And you'll never really lose them

01:47.430 --> 01:50.510
boku no yubi ga subete ni fureru

01:47.430 --> 01:50.510
My fingers touch all of creation

01:50.510 --> 01:55.900
tobira akete haruka kanata e

01:50.510 --> 01:55.900
Open the door and escape to a distant place

02:14.530 --> 02:17.710
A Growing Girl

02:14.530 --> 02:17.710
Translation: rabidkimba; Everything else: Chikushou

02:19.120 --> 02:23.780
Okay then, the Kamiyama household's family meeting is now in session.

02:24.210 --> 02:26.500
As for topics, let's start with Mama.

02:26.960 --> 02:30.230
Yes! Who exactly is this child?

02:32.240 --> 02:35.190
I told you, she was in a crate in front of the house yesterday...

02:35.390 --> 02:36.840
I don't believe that!

02:37.360 --> 02:39.040
That's terrible, Samatarou!

02:39.040 --> 02:42.220
Since when have you had THAT kind of relationship with Tenko?

02:42.970 --> 02:45.310
Um, Mama, it's a misunderstanding!

02:45.310 --> 02:46.820
What's a misunderstanding?

02:47.310 --> 02:50.660
I believed in Samatarou!

02:50.670 --> 02:52.690
I know, but just listen to me!

02:52.690 --> 02:53.680
I don't want to!

02:54.170 --> 02:57.410
I don't remember raising my boy like that!

02:57.410 --> 02:58.660
That's why it's a misunderstanding...

02:58.660 --> 03:00.330
Shut up, you thieving harlot! Harlot!

03:01.090 --> 03:02.760
Mama-san HEARTBREAK!

03:02.760 --> 03:06.120
I won't forgive you. I won't forgive you. I DEFINITELY WON'T FORGIVE YOU!

03:04.960 --> 03:06.120
I'm sorry.

03:07.190 --> 03:09.830
Ai! It's not your fault, Ai!

03:10.350 --> 03:14.980
Please, don't get mad at Papa and Mama, old lady.

03:20.130 --> 03:21.750
Old lady...?

03:25.480 --> 03:28.460
She's wrong. It should be "grandma," right?

03:28.780 --> 03:30.280
Gran.....

03:33.550 --> 03:35.060
"Miss."

03:35.170 --> 03:36.240
Miss?

03:38.210 --> 03:40.870
Oh, what is it, you!

03:40.870 --> 03:43.310
"Miss"? Aw....

03:45.450 --> 03:48.720
You, what's your name again? Beromi?

03:48.980 --> 03:50.510
What kind of name is Beromi?

03:50.510 --> 03:52.310
Samatarou, it's okay.

03:52.310 --> 03:54.680
This girl is now an important member of our family.

03:54.680 --> 03:56.010
What? It's okay?

03:56.010 --> 03:57.220
It's fine, it's fine!

03:57.220 --> 03:58.790
I'll tell your papa.

03:58.790 --> 04:02.490
So pretty much, this kid was abandoned. A stegosaurus!

03:58.790 --> 04:03.970
Note: This flagrantly Japanese pun works as follows: "sutego" means an abandoned child. "Sutego" sounds like "stego," so Mama added "saurus" to the end, making "stegosaurus." Further, "zaorusu" is sometimes used for "dinosaur".

04:02.750 --> 04:03.970
Right? A dinosaur!

04:04.340 --> 04:07.500
Mother, don't say that in front of her!

04:07.930 --> 04:09.200
Hey Papa?

04:10.420 --> 04:12.450
What's an abandoned child?

04:14.010 --> 04:18.550
A dinosaur! They're huge! They're amazing!

04:18.550 --> 04:20.840
When they roar, they're all, "BOEE"!

04:20.840 --> 04:22.920
When they roar, they go, "BOEE"?

04:29.260 --> 04:34.290
"Miss"... It has a nice ring to it! "Miss"...!

04:34.290 --> 04:37.330
Well, I guess this was for the best?

04:38.610 --> 04:40.540
Okay, put your hands through here!

04:40.540 --> 04:41.470
Okay!

04:45.200 --> 04:46.680
Oh no, you're all dirty!

04:46.680 --> 04:47.840
What could that be?

04:47.840 --> 04:49.720
We need to wash that off in the bath tonight!

04:51.660 --> 04:53.070
Okay! You're all ready now!

04:53.390 --> 04:54.580
Isn't that good?

04:55.240 --> 04:56.460
You look cute, Ai!

04:58.770 --> 05:01.350
I'm sorry, but I'm going to go out for a little.

05:01.610 --> 05:02.020
What?

05:02.390 --> 05:04.010
I'm going to go check up on Shinichi.

05:04.330 --> 05:06.790
I'm partially responsible for him falling out of that tree.

05:07.480 --> 05:08.730
Oh yeah.

05:09.310 --> 05:13.850
But you know, raising a kid all by myself is tough, so come back soon!

05:14.290 --> 05:15.270
Come back soon!

05:16.630 --> 05:17.180
Sure thing!

05:20.540 --> 05:22.590
Bye, Papa!

05:25.080 --> 05:25.950
Okay!

05:40.820 --> 05:42.090
What're you looking at?

05:43.080 --> 05:45.540
You still haven't given up?

05:45.600 --> 05:46.670
It's hopeless.

05:46.670 --> 05:48.170
It's not hopeless!

05:48.170 --> 05:50.950
After that, I got pretty far with her.

05:50.950 --> 05:51.700
Seriously?

05:52.450 --> 05:53.500
Okay!

05:53.500 --> 05:55.550
SpecOps officer, I have a mission for you.

05:55.550 --> 05:56.970
Who's the SpecOps officer?

05:56.970 --> 05:59.490
I want to get to know that girl better.

05:59.800 --> 06:05.160
But first, the SpecOps officer needs to get close to her, and ask her, "Do you know where Kirishima is?

06:05.590 --> 06:12.070
The cool-looking, smart, sporty, attractive Kirishima?"

06:12.770 --> 06:19.540
Then that girl will be like, "Oh, Kirishima is that much of a wonderful person?" or something!

06:12.770 --> 06:19.540
Note: "Choki" is the sound of scissors cutting through something. Like in a sudden realization.

06:19.540 --> 06:21.880
Wait, please wait, officer...

06:21.910 --> 06:22.600
I'm not going to wait!

06:23.120 --> 06:25.950
I'll buy you yakisoba bread at the store!

06:26.360 --> 06:28.360
I skipped out on breakfast...

06:28.570 --> 06:30.500
The yakisoba bread comes first!

06:31.460 --> 06:32.460
Alright!

06:34.570 --> 06:36.850
Hey, can I have a word?

06:39.260 --> 06:41.570
Do you know where Kirishima is?

06:41.990 --> 06:48.230
That cool-looking, smart, sporty, attractive guy. That Kirishima.

06:48.610 --> 06:50.120
Who's Kirishima?

06:50.540 --> 06:52.710
Well, it's Shinichi, but...

06:52.710 --> 06:53.950
Shinichi?

06:54.430 --> 06:58.120
Oh, could you mean that dumb-looking flirt?

06:58.400 --> 06:58.990
What?

06:58.990 --> 07:00.710
He hit on you?

07:01.050 --> 07:02.020
He did.

07:02.500 --> 07:04.740
He just came into my room without permission.

07:05.620 --> 07:06.880
Last night and this morning.

07:07.670 --> 07:10.050
Just how desperate is this guy, anyway?

07:13.540 --> 07:15.570
Um... what are you looking at?

07:18.470 --> 07:19.640
Sorry for bothering you.

07:21.570 --> 07:22.330
I'm waiting.

07:25.120 --> 07:26.600
Waiting? Who for?

07:27.430 --> 07:31.050
I know it's pointless to wait, though.

07:31.330 --> 07:32.430
Pointless?

07:34.950 --> 07:37.430
She's not in this world anymore.

07:48.120 --> 07:50.770
Um, have I met you somewhere before?

07:51.050 --> 07:54.460
What? I had that feeling, too...

07:55.290 --> 07:57.880
Like we've met somewhere else.

07:58.810 --> 08:00.530
But I can't remember.

08:00.980 --> 08:04.120
Yeah! It's kind of strange...

08:04.120 --> 08:07.840
Maybe we've met in dreams or something?

08:07.840 --> 08:09.500
That's not possible.

08:10.700 --> 08:14.810
Because the devil always appears in all my dreams.

08:15.500 --> 08:16.460
The devil?

08:16.910 --> 08:17.770
Yeah.

08:20.630 --> 08:24.490
The devil... is thin and has long hair.

08:24.700 --> 08:27.980
She comes in the form of a woman in red clothes.

08:29.600 --> 08:31.050
And then she beckons me.

08:31.670 --> 08:35.700
"Don't stay in a place like that. Come over here."

08:37.040 --> 08:41.490
Then she says, "There's no point in waiting, anyway."

08:43.700 --> 08:49.350
But then, one more girl appears and stops me.

08:50.840 --> 08:54.280
"They'll come to visit you soon, so just wait."

08:55.250 --> 08:59.350
That's why I can't go to the devil.

09:00.390 --> 09:05.630
Because for some reason I believe the girl that tells me to wait.

09:07.800 --> 09:14.040
I'm sorry. Talking about something like devils in my dreams is stupid, isn't it?

09:14.520 --> 09:18.140
Not at all. The devil being in your dreams isn't strange at all.

09:18.590 --> 09:22.250
This is a world that gods and angels live in, after all.

09:26.210 --> 09:27.180
What?

09:27.690 --> 09:29.590
You're a strange one.

09:30.690 --> 09:32.280
Uh, am I?

09:32.280 --> 09:36.250
I may be strange, but holding onto a pillow like that is strange, too.

09:36.250 --> 09:39.180
Oh, this is a replacement.

09:39.180 --> 09:40.280
A replacement?

09:40.930 --> 09:43.730
Yeah, I am strange, aren't I?

09:45.310 --> 09:48.070
Honestly, my legs are fine.

09:48.180 --> 09:49.140
What?

09:49.380 --> 09:52.490
But I don't have the will to walk.

09:54.690 --> 09:57.830
I just think "I've had enough of this world".

09:59.550 --> 10:01.690
"Had enough", eh?

10:02.240 --> 10:03.000
What?

10:04.000 --> 10:05.930
I used to think that, too.

10:07.070 --> 10:10.410
But now, I don't think it's so bad.

10:11.100 --> 10:12.030
What isn't?

10:12.760 --> 10:14.100
This world.

10:15.030 --> 10:21.140
When I finally tried to do something with my own power, the world took on a different light.

10:22.960 --> 10:24.520
Is that from some kind of sermon?

10:24.520 --> 10:26.580
No, not like that.

10:27.240 --> 10:30.070
I'm fine, just waiting.

10:31.790 --> 10:33.480
What's your name?

10:33.930 --> 10:35.550
Kamiyama Samatarou.

10:36.000 --> 10:38.930
Samatarou. I'm-

10:38.930 --> 10:42.510
YOU TRAITOR!

10:42.550 --> 10:43.860
Chest hit!

10:45.510 --> 10:46.480
Are you okay?

10:46.720 --> 10:48.270
Hey, what are you doing?

10:48.440 --> 10:49.620
Oh, I'm sorry!

10:49.820 --> 10:53.510
I was sure you were being attacked by a pro wrestler!

10:53.510 --> 10:55.620
But now that I look at him, it's just Samatarou!

10:55.620 --> 10:57.440
Wake up, okay, GO!

10:57.790 --> 10:58.960
Don't say "GO"!

10:58.960 --> 10:59.890
Go away!

10:59.890 --> 11:01.340
Where?

11:01.340 --> 11:03.100
Somewhere else!

11:03.960 --> 11:06.790
I'm telling you to get out of my sight!

11:12.920 --> 11:14.370
Papa's so slow.

11:14.370 --> 11:19.540
Isn't he? Shinichi probably put him up to no good again.

11:19.540 --> 11:21.750
Shinichi is no good!

11:21.860 --> 11:22.990
Yep, yep!

11:22.990 --> 11:24.410
He's no good.

11:24.650 --> 11:28.610
Your father has a weakness called "yakisoba bread", you see?

11:28.960 --> 11:31.540
At times like this, we have to come to his rescue, you see?

11:31.680 --> 11:32.820
Rescue!

11:35.580 --> 11:37.340
Mama, what's wrong?

11:40.510 --> 11:42.650
Hey, what are you spacing out like that for?

11:42.960 --> 11:44.230
No good!

11:44.960 --> 11:47.060
Oh... Tenko!

11:47.370 --> 11:48.750
Where's Samatarou?

11:48.750 --> 11:50.090
Samatarou?

11:51.060 --> 11:53.090
NICE question!

11:54.300 --> 11:56.890
Samatarou is right there!

11:59.200 --> 12:02.300
As you can see, he's right back in love-love mode!

12:02.300 --> 12:04.300
WHAT IS THAT?

12:04.300 --> 12:07.200
YOU TOLD ME YOU'D BE VISITING SHINICHI!

12:07.750 --> 12:09.320
Too bad for you, Samatarou!

12:09.320 --> 12:11.320
You had it coming. You need to taught a tough lesson!

12:11.470 --> 12:12.710
Oh, a dragonfly!

12:17.020 --> 12:18.160
Thank goodness!

12:18.160 --> 12:20.470
I had no idea what to do when you got knocked down!

12:20.780 --> 12:25.230
He's not really a bad guy, but he sometimes goes a little crazy.

12:26.120 --> 12:27.850
Crazy?

12:29.090 --> 12:32.470
Hey, Samatarou, will you come again?

12:32.920 --> 12:37.090
Sure! Shinichi is going to be in the hospital for a while, so...

12:38.670 --> 12:40.160
Not like that.

12:40.500 --> 12:42.260
Will you come back to meet me?

12:43.710 --> 12:46.570
You listened to what I had to say...

12:47.090 --> 12:49.050
You're the first person to do that.

12:55.500 --> 12:57.770
SAMATAROU, YOU IDIOT!

12:59.330 --> 13:01.500
Um, sorry, one second!

13:02.640 --> 13:04.600
Wait up, Tenko!

13:05.430 --> 13:07.950
Time to face her wrath, Samatarou?

13:08.120 --> 13:12.020
Now my lucky chance HAS COME!

13:12.020 --> 13:13.500
So it's like that!

13:13.500 --> 13:14.570
He has a girlfriend!

13:14.570 --> 13:15.950
But you know, I'm free-

13:15.460 --> 13:18.390
Even if he has a girlfriend, Samatarou is a wonderful person!

13:18.390 --> 13:19.740
He's nothing like you!

13:45.460 --> 13:47.120
Hey, I told you to wait!

13:47.460 --> 13:48.700
It's a misunderstanding! I'm telling you.

13:48.700 --> 13:49.740
You have it all wrong!

13:49.740 --> 13:52.120
I don't want to hear it, you cheater!

13:52.560 --> 13:57.250
"Cheater"? It's not like I'm your lover or anything!

13:57.430 --> 13:59.290
But what about Ai?

13:59.290 --> 14:00.250
You're a Papa!

14:00.250 --> 14:01.770
Well, that's true, but...

14:01.770 --> 14:03.050
Wait... it's true?

14:06.490 --> 14:08.080
How'd it become like this?

14:09.350 --> 14:13.630
The old Samatarou never had any interest in human girls.

14:14.180 --> 14:16.290
That's true, but...

14:16.730 --> 14:18.460
You've got it good, don't you?

14:18.460 --> 14:23.840
You have Papa. You have Mama. You have Misa and Meme, too.

14:24.020 --> 14:26.180
I think it's a wonderful family.

14:28.530 --> 14:31.040
But I don't have anything.

14:32.870 --> 14:35.490
Even so, you cheat on me.

14:35.490 --> 14:36.700
I can't believe it!

14:38.830 --> 14:40.830
<i>All I have is Samatarou.</i>

14:41.830 --> 14:44.590
<i>Protecting Samatarou is all I can do.</i>

14:45.760 --> 14:47.010
I don't understand what you're saying.

14:47.010 --> 14:49.010
You're part of the family.

14:49.010 --> 14:51.280
You're wrong! I'm the only angel!

14:51.280 --> 14:52.520
That doesn't matter!

14:52.520 --> 14:53.250
It does!

14:53.250 --> 14:53.900
It doesn't!

14:54.660 --> 14:55.900
Hey, you know...!

14:58.210 --> 14:59.970
W-w-what is it?

14:59.970 --> 15:01.560
I forgot about Ai-chan!

15:07.900 --> 15:09.310
She isn't here. What should we do?

15:09.590 --> 15:10.970
Ai-chan is small, you know!

15:11.140 --> 15:12.970
She was a baby just yesterday!

15:13.140 --> 15:15.240
She doesn't know the difference between left and right!

15:15.240 --> 15:16.550
Calm down!

15:16.550 --> 15:19.240
Just to make sure, you go check Shinichi's room.

15:19.490 --> 15:20.550
I'll go look.

15:20.550 --> 15:21.760
Where?

15:22.000 --> 15:22.930
Everywhere!

15:32.520 --> 15:35.280
Where is she? Where'd Ai go?

15:36.450 --> 15:39.100
Samatarou, did you find Ai?

15:39.550 --> 15:42.280
Not yet! I'll tell you when I find her!

15:45.590 --> 15:47.590
Could she have gone outside?

15:51.620 --> 15:53.310
Hey you!

15:53.310 --> 15:56.240
Have you seen a kindergarten-aged girl around here?

15:56.240 --> 15:57.900
Oh! Papa!

15:59.380 --> 16:01.790
Papa! Papa!

16:02.340 --> 16:04.140
Papa, welcome back!

16:04.140 --> 16:05.580
Ai, is it you?

16:06.170 --> 16:07.510
That's right, Papa!

16:07.830 --> 16:10.410
Are you serious...?

16:11.720 --> 16:14.170
I don't get it anymore.

16:16.380 --> 16:19.690
She got bigger last night when she was asleep, right?

16:20.580 --> 16:22.510
Sleeping children grow?

16:22.510 --> 16:26.440
Yeah, but she grew while she was awake, today.

16:27.120 --> 16:29.580
Mama... boeeeee

16:30.510 --> 16:32.340
Mama is right here.

16:32.620 --> 16:34.200
And Papa is here too.

16:36.170 --> 16:37.650
She's so cute!

16:38.130 --> 16:38.580
Yeah.

16:43.580 --> 16:44.990
Understand, Ai?

16:45.820 --> 16:49.890
If you get lost again, it'll be a problem, so don't go outside!

16:50.230 --> 16:52.170
Make sure to stay at home!

16:52.580 --> 16:54.960
Okay! Papa! Mama!

16:54.960 --> 16:58.990
It's fine. I'm cutting classes, so I can look over her.

16:59.200 --> 17:00.410
Please do.

17:00.890 --> 17:03.650
If it was just Mama, then I'd be a little concerned...

17:04.160 --> 17:05.270
Leave it to me.

17:06.130 --> 17:08.850
Okay, I'm going to leave, Ai!

17:09.060 --> 17:12.580
Bye! Papa! Mama!

17:12.890 --> 17:14.580
Okay, see you guys later.

17:15.470 --> 17:17.060
Bye!

17:17.060 --> 17:18.920
We're leaving!

17:22.820 --> 17:24.160
Okay, then.

17:25.160 --> 17:27.890
Time to start your interrogation.

17:28.440 --> 17:30.440
Interro...gation?

17:32.540 --> 17:36.780
So, do you remember anything from before you came here?

17:36.780 --> 17:37.950
From before I came here?

17:37.950 --> 17:39.640
Yeah! C'mon, tell me!

17:39.640 --> 17:41.090
Uriuriuri~

17:41.780 --> 17:45.190
Um... I'm not very sure.

17:45.190 --> 17:47.190
You don't understand...

17:47.190 --> 17:51.610
Okay, then. Why are you growing up so fast?

17:51.610 --> 17:53.920
Fast? I am?

17:54.160 --> 17:56.570
I don't really know about that either.

17:56.570 --> 18:01.880
Hm... interrogations are pretty tough, too...

18:02.300 --> 18:05.400
Okay! Time to look for clues!

18:05.400 --> 18:06.470
Clues?

18:06.810 --> 18:09.430
We're going to play detective in Samatarou's room!

18:09.430 --> 18:10.710
In Papa's room?

18:10.710 --> 18:11.670
I'm coming too!

18:12.470 --> 18:14.610
I'll get something to drink, so you go ahead.

18:14.610 --> 18:15.610
Okay!

18:16.540 --> 18:19.050
Detective! Detective! Detective!

18:20.500 --> 18:21.810
Ow...

18:39.740 --> 18:41.360
Okay! Thanks for waiting!

18:44.460 --> 18:46.500
D-Did you eat something?

18:47.190 --> 18:49.190
What? What's the matter?

18:49.190 --> 18:51.190
You just got bigger!

18:51.190 --> 18:52.500
Woah...

18:52.840 --> 18:55.950
What? Am I getting bigger?

18:56.080 --> 18:57.980
You are, you are!

18:59.780 --> 19:00.980
This is great, this is great!

19:00.980 --> 19:02.940
This is going to be a lot of fun...

19:03.150 --> 19:05.320
You'd look great in a school swimming suit

19:05.320 --> 19:06.740
School swimming suit?

19:07.120 --> 19:10.600
Oh! I just thought of something great!

19:11.630 --> 19:15.190
This is Samatarou's, and this is Tenko's, okay?

19:15.730 --> 19:17.190
Are these lunches?

19:17.320 --> 19:20.460
Yep! Can you go give these to them at their school?

19:20.460 --> 19:24.050
Um, but, Mama said not to go to her school.

19:24.050 --> 19:25.630
Oh, it's fine, it's fine!

19:25.940 --> 19:30.150
You need to find Papa and tell him you grew up!

19:32.250 --> 19:37.420
Okay, remember what I told you, and make sure to carry your mission to completition!

19:37.420 --> 19:39.630
Okay! Roger!

19:45.770 --> 19:49.910
Misa! Don't tease that girl too much!

19:49.910 --> 19:51.910
Okay, Miss!

19:52.250 --> 19:53.590
Oh my!

19:58.080 --> 20:01.390
Hm... so it's like that?

20:03.840 --> 20:06.560
<i>I wonder what Ai is doing right now?</i>

20:07.010 --> 20:09.180
<i>Misa is looking over her, but...</i>

20:09.700 --> 20:11.730
<i>Ugh, I feel kind of worried.</i>

20:12.280 --> 20:13.280
What the?

20:14.250 --> 20:15.280
Who's that girl?

20:15.210 --> 20:16.080
She's in a swimsuit, isn't she?

20:16.080 --> 20:16.660
Who's that?

20:26.320 --> 20:27.320
AI!

20:27.320 --> 20:28.040
WHAT?

20:30.250 --> 20:31.450
I found you!

20:31.450 --> 20:32.730
Papa! Mama!

20:33.310 --> 20:34.210
Don't come here.

20:34.210 --> 20:35.520
No, you can't!

20:35.520 --> 20:37.690
Papa is telling me to come over there!

20:37.690 --> 20:38.730
Papa!

20:39.350 --> 20:40.870
Papa! Mama!

20:41.800 --> 20:43.000
What?

20:43.490 --> 20:45.040
I brought you your lunches!

20:45.040 --> 20:47.070
Ai helped make these!

20:45.040 --> 20:47.070
Note: This is a horrible pun. "Ai" = "I"

20:47.070 --> 20:48.450
Okay, Papa, Mama!

20:49.420 --> 20:50.800
It's too late...

20:50.800 --> 20:53.210
T-thank you, Ai.

20:53.730 --> 20:55.140
Samatarou is Papa?

20:55.140 --> 20:56.590
Tenko is Mama?

20:56.590 --> 20:59.070
That girl must be in middle school!

20:59.170 --> 21:01.040
When did they have her?

21:01.730 --> 21:04.280
I grew up again!

21:04.420 --> 21:06.140
Yeah. It sure looks like it...

21:07.790 --> 21:12.380
Oh yeah, and Misa told me that I could get a treat if I delivered those lunches!

21:13.970 --> 21:15.380
A treat?

21:15.380 --> 21:17.310
Yeah! A kiss on the cheek!

21:22.210 --> 21:24.650
C'mon, Papa! Hurry up!

21:27.590 --> 21:29.480
Guess I have to...

21:38.960 --> 21:41.240
WHAT IS WRONG WITH YOU?

21:41.240 --> 21:47.620
What? I just thought she should show you how she grew.

21:47.620 --> 21:50.030
Even so, why in a school swimsuit?

21:50.030 --> 21:53.510
The whole rest of my school day was a living Hell!

21:54.030 --> 21:58.200
I'm sorry... did I make trouble for Papa and Mama?

21:58.440 --> 22:01.370
No... it wasn't your fault, Ai.

22:02.310 --> 22:06.170
Anyway, don't make Ai do any more weird things!

22:06.340 --> 22:09.170
Was that weird? I thought it looked good on her...

22:09.170 --> 22:11.100
That's not the problem here!

22:11.100 --> 22:16.890
Samatarou-chin~ I found something wonderful, you know.

22:17.060 --> 22:17.860
What?

22:18.030 --> 22:18.650
This!

22:20.510 --> 22:21.410
A picture?

22:22.100 --> 22:23.680
Oh, this was in Ai's cradle...

22:23.860 --> 22:24.720
WHAT?

22:25.440 --> 22:26.960
This is... AI!

22:40.200 --> 22:45.690
aru asa totsuzen (uh huh) sekai ga kawattete (kawattete)

22:40.200 --> 22:45.690
The world suddenly changed one morning

22:46.560 --> 22:52.150
kaeri no tochuu de (uh huh) kimi ni kissu sareru no (sareru no)

22:46.560 --> 22:52.150
While we were on the way home, you unexpectedly kissed me

22:52.560 --> 22:56.540
sonna no aru wake nai ka

22:52.560 --> 22:56.540
I doubt something like that would ever happen though

22:59.400 --> 23:04.140
dakara atashi kara ippo fumidasu kedo

22:59.400 --> 23:04.140
That's why my shoulders sank when you stepped away from me

23:05.650 --> 23:10.840
suki na taipu kiite kata wo otoshita

23:05.650 --> 23:10.840
And told me about the kinda girls you like

23:11.080 --> 23:17.430
atama ni doonatsu wo nosete mitemo

23:11.080 --> 23:17.430
Even if you put a doughnut over your head

23:18.310 --> 23:24.550
kore dake ja tenshi ni mienai (nainai kana)

23:18.310 --> 23:24.550
It wouldn't be enough to make you look like an angel!

23:25.820 --> 23:31.770
o~o kamisama onegai (kamisama onegai) kiru sugita maegami

23:25.820 --> 23:31.770
Oh please, God! Allow the bangs I cut too short

23:31.770 --> 23:37.500
sugu modoshitai nanto ka shiteyo

23:31.770 --> 23:37.500
To grow back quickly! You can do it somehow

23:37.530 --> 23:39.380
kotaenasai

23:37.530 --> 23:39.380
Please answer my prayer!

23:39.410 --> 23:47.190
sore ja naykkya ano wanpiisu ga niaeba

23:39.410 --> 23:47.190
Or at least let that one piece look good on me

23:47.230 --> 23:52.360
subete wa umaku iku yo, tabun

23:47.230 --> 23:52.360
Then everything will turn out okay... probably!

24:04.140 --> 24:06.030
The girl in the picture is Ai?

24:06.030 --> 24:08.140
Ai, is there anything you can remember?

24:08.140 --> 24:11.890
I had a dream... a girl in a red one-piece...

24:11.890 --> 24:12.960
A dream?

24:12.960 --> 24:15.480
If she meets that girl at the hospital, something must...

24:15.480 --> 24:17.960
Thank you, Papa, Mama.

24:17.960 --> 24:20.200
Ai-chan, you aren't going to disappear, are you?

24:21.070 --> 24:23.070
Next time on Kamisama Kazoku...

24:23.170 --> 24:24.860
A Precious Friend.

24:25.560 --> 24:27.690
One day, we'll become a real family...
